sequenceDiagram
    actor Maya
    participant CLI as CMP-001 Analyst Experience Portal
    participant Intake as CMP-002 Regulatory Intake Boundary
    participant Flow as CMP-003 Single-turn orchestration
    participant Model as Provider-neutral model gateway
    participant Validate as Deterministic evidence validator
    participant Artifacts as CMP-009 local evidence artifacts

    Maya->>CLI: Submit text/Markdown publication + metadata
    CLI->>Intake: Validate type, size, UTF-8 and provenance
    Intake-->>Flow: DATA-001 + SHA-256 + numbered lines
    Flow->>Model: One structured summarization request
    Model-->>Flow: Candidate JSON payload
    Flow->>Validate: Validate schema, line ranges, excerpts
    alt validation succeeds
        Validate-->>Flow: DATA-015 preliminary summary
        Flow->>Artifacts: Persist source, metadata, invocation, summary
        Flow-->>CLI: preliminary_unapproved
        CLI-->>Maya: Reviewable JSON and artifact path
    else validation fails
        Validate-->>Flow: explicit failure
        Flow-->>CLI: no successful summary
        CLI-->>Maya: Error; manual process remains available
    end
